    "md5": "85ef9df5afdef838bf2c6bc838b830ed",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1959,
    "chunk_text": "\"Authorized Officer\u201d shall mean any officer duly authorized by the Chairman in writing in that period.\n\n12. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala, Tamil and English versions of this by-law, the Sinhala text\n\nshall prevail.\n\n12-687/9\n\nRAMBUKKANA PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nBy- Law regarding Maintenance of Meat Stalls\n\nTHIS is to notify that I, Dhamma Dissanayake, Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province has approved the By-law regarding maintenance of Meat Stalls within authoritative area of Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha, prepared by the Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha by virtue of powers vested in it under Section 122 read with Section 126 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act No. 15 of 1987 and passed at its General meeting held on 25.06.2019, by virtue of powers vested under Section 123(1) of Pradeshiya Sabha Act read with Section 2 of Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act No. 12 of 1989, and it will be effective within authoritative area of Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha from the date this notification is published in the Gazette. DHAMMA DISSANAYAKE, Governor, Sabaragamuwa Province. At the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council, On this 30th day of October, 2019. By-Law on the maintenance of Meat Stalls within the Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area\n\n1. This By-Law is enacted to regulate, administer and control the operation of meat outlets within the area of authority of Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n61A IV(\u0d85) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019\n\n2. This by-law is known as the by-law on the sale of meat in authoritative area of Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n3. A person who wishes to obtain a license pursuant to this by-law shall apply by an application prepared in accordance with the first schedule of this by law."
  },
