y-Law on the Maintenance of Retail Shops within Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area\n\n1. This By-Law is enacted to regulate, administer and control the retail shops in the area of the Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n2. This by-law is known as the By-Law on the Maintenance of Retail Shops within Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area\n\n3. (1) No person shall maintain a shop for the sale of goods for human consumption unless there is a valid license"
