    "chunk_size_bytes": 2072,
    "chunk_text": "I recommend issuing a license for the relevant place as per above application. (If not recommended, state the reason.)\n\n........................... Date: - Medical Officer of Health. 12-689/6\n\n_______________________________\n\nBULATHKOHUPITIYA PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nTHIS is to notify that I, Dhamma Dissanayake, Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province has approved the By-law regarding maintenance of Tea, Coffee and Short Eat Shops within authoritative area of Bulathkohupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha, prepared by the Bulathkohupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha by virtue of powers vested in it under Section 122 read with Section 126 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of 1987 and passed at its general meeting held on 31.07.2019, by virtue of powers vested under Section 123(1) of Pradeshiya Sabha Act read with section 2 of Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989, and it will be effective within authoritative area of Bulathkohupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha from the date this notification is published in the Gazette.\n\nDHAMMA DISSANAYAKE, Governor, Sabaragamuwa Province. At the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council, On this 30th day of October, 2019.\n\n45A IV(\u0d85) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019\n\nBy-law on the Maintenance of Tea, Coffee and Short Eat Shops in Bulathkohupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha\n\nAuthoritative Area\n\n1. This By-Law is enacted to regulate, administer and standardize the operation of the Tea Coffee Shops, Short-selling Points within the Bulathkohupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area.\n\n2. This by-law is known as the By-Law of the tea, coffee and short eat shops in Bulathkohupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area.\n\n3.(1) If only any person has a valid license issued by the Chairman of any premises within the area of the Bulathkohupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha (hereinafter referred to as the area shall run a coffee shop or a snack bar."
  },
