.\n\n\"Pradeshiya Sabha\" shall mean Bulathkohupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n\"Medical Officer\" shall mean the person holding the office of any Medical Officer of Health in the area of\n\nthe Pradeshiya Sabha."
