th in the area of the Divisional Council area.\n\n\"Public Health Inspector\" shall mean the person holding the office of any Public Health Inspector in the area of the Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n\"Authorized officer\" shall mean any officer authorized by the Chairman at the moment,"
