    "chunk_text": "...................... Date: - Medical Officer of Health -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSecond Schedule\n\nMedical Certificate issued to the worker in a meat stall\n\n....................... ............................ Date Medical Officer of Health (Official Seal) 12-690/10\n\nPhotograph\n\n67A IV(\u0d85) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019\n\nGALIGAMUWA PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nBy- Law Regarding Maintenance of Fish Stalls\n\nTHIS is to notify that I, Dhamma Dissanayake, Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province has approved the By-law regarding maintenance of Fish Stalls within authoritative area of Galigamuwa Pradeshiya Sabha, prepared by the Galigamuwa Pradeshiya Sabha by virtue of powers vested in it under Section 122 read with Section 126 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act No. 15 of 1987 and passed at its General meeting held on 09.07.2019, by virtue of powers vested under Section 123(1) of Pradeshiya Sabha Act read with Section 2 of Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act No. 12 of 1989, and it will be effective within authoritative area of Galigamuwa Pradeshiya Sabha from the date this notification is published in the Gazette. DHAMMA DISSANAYAKE, Governor, Sabaragamuwa Province. At the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council, On this 30th day of October, 2019.\n\nBy-Law on the Maintenance of Fish Stalls within the Galigamuwa Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area\n\n01. This by-law is enacted to regulate, administer and control the operation of fish stalls within Galigamuwa Pradeshiya Sabha area.\n\n02. This by-law is known as the By-Law of the sale of fish within the Galigamuwa pradeshiya sabha authoritative area."
  },
