    "chunk_text": "Note:- (i) The Public Service Commission will approve a detailed marking scheme forthe interview for evaluating eligibility within the maximum marks allocated for themain areas for which marks are awarded as stated in part I of the table above.\n\n(II) Practical Test\n\n(a) This is a practical test for a presentation on a given topic relating to the subject.\n\nMain headings for which marksTotalMinimumare awardedMarksMarks\n\n1. Approach05\n\n3. Style of presentation10\n\n4. Time Management10\n\n5. Summarization05\n\nTotal50\n\n(v) A Post Graduate Degree in Education with a Preliminary Degree in the relevant area ofsubject.(Should have obtained a Post Graduate Degree in Education with the Degreefor vocational subjects.)\n\nSalary increments of officers recruited under these minimum qualifications stated inSchedule VII of the Service Minute and failing to fulfill the basic educationalqualifications prescribed in the Service Minute in relation to the subject they wererecruited for within 05 years from the date of their recruitment should be stopped untilthey complete the relevant qualifications. The relevant promotion of such officers toGrade II will be delayed by a period equal to the additional period they spent to completethe relevant qualifications.\n\n(iii) Thrice the number of vacancies from among those who obtained the minimum marksand above required to pass the written examination will be called for the general interview.The general interview will be conducted by a Board of Interview appointed by the PublicService Commission.\n\n(iv) Only the candidates who completed the basic qualifications from among those who sitfor the general interview will be called for the interview for evaluating eligibility andthe practical test."
