    "chunk_text": "26. Lot No. 27 Name of the Land: Wadugedarawatta ; Description of Land: Home Garden; Claimant: State; Part of the Lot Nos. 22, 23 and 24 of PP 1626, Taken over under Section 38(A) of the Land Acquisition Act; Original Claimant: R.D.Sirisena, Detached allotment, To finalize the land acquisition. Extent:0.0106 Hectares. (106sq.m)\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid Land servitude are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents dully authorized in writing, before me at Mallawapitiya\n\nDivisional Secretariat, on the day of the 02.04.2020 at 10.00 a.m.\n\nAnd are hereby requested to inform me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 17.03.2020 the nature of their interest in the land/servitude the particular of their claims for computation for the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nE.A.S. EDIRISINGHE, Divisional Seceratary/ Mallawapitiya. (Acting).\n\nAt the Divisional Secretariat, Mallawapitiya, 19th November, 2019. 12 - 822"
