    "chunk_text": "02. Lot No. : 423 Name of the land : Kurunduwaththapashawulaovita, Pashawulaovita alias Kurunduwaththaaddara Mahaliyadda and Kukalaneovita; Description : Home garden and Part of\n\na permanent building; Claimant : State; Original Claimant : Hewa Marambage Dharmasena; Extent : about 0.0013 hectare\n\n04. Lot No. : 427 Name of the land : Kurunduwaththapashawulaovita, Pashawulaovita alias Kurunduwaththaaddara Mahaliyadda, Wallambagalaelaaddaraovita and and Kukalaneovita.; Description: Home garden and mix cultivation; Claimant : State; Original Claimant: Could not be traced; Extent: about 0.0020 hectare\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/ servitude on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat \u2013 Galle Four Gravets on 23.12.2019 at 9.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 16.12.2019, the nature of their interests in the land/ lands, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nI. HIMALI RATHNAWEERA, Divisional Secretary, Galle Four Gravets. At Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office, Galle - Four Gravets. 06th December 2019\n\n12 - 889/2"
