    "chunk_text": "D. C. ARAVINTHARAJ,Returning Officer,Karachchi Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Kilinochchi,10th December, 2019.\n\n12 - 890/1\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\n2AIV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'12Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.12.2019\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE KARACHCHI PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Karachchi Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Ilankai Tamil Arasu Kadchi, the recognized political party to whichPirabamany Kanesamoorthy the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance,to decide upon returned member of that Ilankai Tamil Arasu Kadchi who belongs to such party and is not disqualifiedunder Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within aperiod of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Lalithakumari Saththiyamoorthi to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Denicius Canute Aravintharaj, Returning Officer of the Karachchi Pradeshsiya Sabha,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatLalithakumari Saththiyamoorthi was selected as the member of the Karachchi Pradeshsiya Sabha.\n\nD. C. ARAVINTHARAJ,Returning Officer,Karachchi Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Kilinochchi,10th December, 2019.\n\n12 - 890/2\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA